sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Resolver as Recursive resolver
    participant Root as Root nameserver
    participant TLD as TLD nameserver
    participant Auth as Authoritative nameserver

    Client->>Resolver: Query www.example.com
    Resolver->>Resolver: Check local cache
    alt Cached answer within TTL
        Resolver-->>Client: Cached answer
    else Cache miss
        Resolver->>Root: Query www.example.com
        Root-->>Resolver: Referral to .com TLD nameserver
        Resolver->>TLD: Query www.example.com
        TLD-->>Resolver: Referral to example.com authoritative nameserver
        Resolver->>Auth: Query www.example.com
        Auth-->>Resolver: A record answer with TTL
        Resolver->>Resolver: Store answer in cache for the TTL
        Resolver-->>Client: A record answer
    end
